abstract: >-
  ABTC selects decision thresholds for imbalanced binary classification by combining
  isotonic calibration, a prior adjustment of the calibrated probability and a
  metric-driven (Path A) or cost-driven (Path B) threshold rule.
keywords:
  - imbalanced classification
  - threshold selection
  - calibration
  - cost-sensitive learning
